                                "sense_id": "156f58f3-c37f-3419-9f9a-76bc97aaf1dd",
                                "text": "The cetaceans (whales and dolphins) together with the sirenians (sea cows and manatees) are the sea mammals best-adapted to the seas of today, but it is the cetaceans that have most engaged the attention of mankind as both prey and fellow sentient being."
